# EcoCart - Organic E-Commerce Website
##live demo https://ecocart-ecommerce.netlify.app/
A fully responsive e-commerce website for organic products, built with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

## Features

- **Product Catalog**: Browse products by category
- **Shopping Cart**: Add/remove items, adjust quantities
- **Responsive Design**: Works on all device sizes
- **Product Details**: Detailed view with nutrition info
- **Contact Form**: Customer communication
- **About Page**: Company information

## File Structure
ecocart/
- ├── index.html # Homepage
- ├── shop.html # Product listing
- ├── product.html # Single product view
- ├── cart.html # Shopping cart
- ├── about.html # About us page
- ├── contact.html # Contact page
- ├── styles.css # Main stylesheet
- ├── script.js # Global JavaScript
- ├── products-data.js # Product database
- ├── cart.js # Cart functionality
- ├── product.js # Product page scripts
- ├── shop-script.js # Shop page scripts
- ├── images/ # Product images
- └── README.md # This file


## Installation

No installation required - just open `index.html` in a web browser.

## Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript (ES6)
- Font Awesome (v6.4.0)
- Google Fonts

## Customization

1. **Products**: Edit `products-data.js` to add/remove products
2. **Styling**: Modify `styles.css` for visual changes
3. **Business Info**: Update contact details in `contact.html`

## Browser Support

- Chrome (latest)
- Firefox (latest)
- Safari (latest)
- Edge (latest)

## Known Issues

- Cart persistence uses localStorage (clears when browser cache is cleared)
- Checkout process is simulated (no real payment processing)

## Future Improvements

- User authentication system
- Product search functionality
- Payment gateway integration
- Admin dashboard for product management

